{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50758","headline":"古镜謌 · 张祜","name":"古镜謌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"小儿行把街中剧，千年𥘴斗铜衣碧\n将金换得试磨看，俄见洞门深一尺。\n夜深时出仰照天，二十八宿中相连。\n青龙耀跃麟眼动，神鬼不敢当庭总之。\n明朝擎出游都市，一半狐狸落城死。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50758.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50758","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}